fooyin: fooyin (customisable music player)
fooyin:
fooyin: fooyin is a music player built around customisation. It provides a
fooyin: variety of widgets to help you manage and play your local collection.
fooyin:
fooyin: It's highly extensible with a plugin system and includes FooScript, a
fooyin: scripting language for advanced configuration of widgets. A layout
fooyin: editing mode enables the entire user interface to be customised,
fooyin: starting from a blank slate or a preset layout.
fooyin:
fooyin: Homepage: https://fooyin.org/
